## ItemsApi

### List item attributes
## List item attributes
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/item-attribute/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get item attribute
## Get item attribute
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/item-attribute/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

